  Description: You love few things more than a good book, and as a result, Odd Stories
    is your favorite shop in Otari. The bookseller Morlibint supplies you with fiction,
    anthologies, and other delightful reads, and he's always eager to discuss his
    latest finds with you. You know that imagination is the greatest magic, but a
    working knowledge of actual magic helps, too. Choose two attribute boosts. One
    must be to Intelligence or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You're
    trained in the Arcana skill and the Library Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Arcane
    Sense] skill feat.
